WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.409
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:45.679 --> 00:46.600
What are you doing?

3
00:47.280 --> 00:47.679
Let go!

4
00:48.079 --> 00:48.880
Let go of me!

5
00:49.759 --> 00:50.799
What the hell do you want?

6
00:51.280 --> 00:52.119
Let me go!

7
00:52.840 --> 00:53.240
Let—

8
00:53.759 --> 00:54.240
Get in!

9
00:55.759 --> 00:56.399
What are you doing?

10
00:57.359 --> 00:58.079
Didn't I tell you...

11
00:58.119 --> 01:00.439
tell you to wait for me right there?

12
01:00.560 --> 01:01.719
You run pretty fast, huh?

13
01:01.799 --> 01:02.479
Still trying to run?

14
01:03.200 --> 01:04.079
What do you want?

15
01:04.359 --> 01:05.120
What do I want?

16
01:05.120 --> 01:05.719
Where's the money?

17
01:06.760 --> 01:07.799
That money's mine now.

18
01:08.120 --> 01:09.319
I earned it drink by drink!

19
01:10.359 --> 01:11.000
Oh, please!

20
01:11.000 --> 01:12.120
You really think you're worth that much?

21
01:12.120 --> 01:12.840
Ten thousand a glass?

22
01:13.120 --> 01:13.719
Where's your bag?

23
01:14.000 --> 01:15.000
Where's the bag? Don't touch me!

24
01:15.120 --> 01:15.719
Where's the bag?

25
01:16.480 --> 01:17.480
Where'd you hide the money?

26
01:18.480 --> 01:19.439
The money is mine!

27
01:19.640 --> 01:20.519
None of your business where I hid it!

28
01:22.280 --> 01:23.280
So you want to...

29
01:23.439 --> 01:24.359
save it for your son, huh?

30
01:25.599 --> 01:26.040
Leizi!

31
01:26.200 --> 01:27.000
Drive to her place.

32
01:27.519 --> 01:28.400
Don't you touch my son!

33
01:28.760 --> 01:29.920
Fine, I won't touch your son.

34
01:30.079 --> 01:31.560
Then I'll touch you instead.

35
01:31.640 --> 01:32.959
Don't... don't mess around!

36
01:33.599 --> 01:34.439
Let go!

37
01:34.599 --> 01:35.519
Let go of me!

38
01:36.640 --> 01:37.359
I'm telling you!

39
01:37.519 --> 01:38.680
Keep this up and I'll jump!

40
01:38.920 --> 01:39.719
Jump then! Go ahead!

41
01:39.879 --> 01:40.359
Jump!

42
01:40.439 --> 01:40.920
Leizi!

43
01:40.920 --> 01:41.640
Speed it up for her!

44
01:41.719 --> 01:42.159
Got it!

45
01:42.519 --> 01:43.640
Think I can't handle you?

46
01:44.280 --> 01:45.959
Swan meat doesn't even taste good.

47
01:48.920 --> 01:50.000
Pull over! Stop the car!

48
01:50.400 --> 01:51.000
Pull over for what?

49
01:51.000 --> 01:51.400
Boss...

50
01:51.400 --> 01:52.359
It's pitch black outside.

51
01:52.519 --> 01:52.879
Leizi, what...

52
01:52.879 --> 01:53.840
what did you just say?

53
01:54.439 --> 01:55.480
Who're you calling a swan?

54
01:56.000 --> 01:57.159
If she's a swan, what am I?

55
01:57.280 --> 01:57.640
I... uh...

56
01:57.760 --> 01:58.359
Stop the car!

57
01:58.519 --> 01:59.000
Hurry up!

58
02:02.640 --> 02:03.879
Oh, for God's sake!

59
02:04.760 --> 02:06.280
Piss off, both of you! Get out!

60
02:06.879 --> 02:08.159
Boss, it's freezing out there!

61
02:08.319 --> 02:09.319
It's over thirty below zero!

62
02:09.680 --> 02:10.199
Get out!

63
02:10.479 --> 02:11.039
Come on, Boss...

64
02:11.039 --> 02:11.599
You... you...

65
02:11.759 --> 02:13.120
just do whatever you want!

66
02:13.120 --> 02:13.919
We won't look!

67
02:14.080 --> 02:14.960
I'll close my eyes, completely shut!

68
02:15.479 --> 02:16.520
Get out of the car, hear me?

69
02:19.159 --> 02:19.960
Come on, let's go see.

70
02:21.639 --> 02:22.319
Chase her!

71
02:24.639 --> 02:25.199
How did she...

72
02:25.560 --> 02:26.560
How'd she wake up?

73
02:30.560 --> 02:31.120
Don't run!

74
02:31.479 --> 02:32.439
Don't let her get away!

75
02:33.479 --> 02:33.919
Right!

76
02:46.400 --> 02:47.039
Are you okay?

77
02:50.000 --> 02:50.680
Are you all right?

78
02:52.919 --> 02:53.639
What's going on?

79
02:53.639 --> 02:54.080
What's wrong with her?

80
02:54.120 --> 02:55.240
Why is she convulsing?

81
02:55.280 --> 02:55.719
Boss!

82
02:55.840 --> 02:56.199
Boss!

83
02:56.599 --> 02:57.199
What do we do?

84
02:57.479 --> 02:57.840
What now?

85
02:57.840 --> 02:58.840
Stop bullshitting!

86
02:59.400 --> 03:00.199
What do we do, Boss?

87
03:00.680 --> 03:01.080
This...

88
03:01.800 --> 03:02.840
Should we take her to the hospital?

89
03:03.400 --> 03:03.960
We can't take her to the hospital.

90
03:03.960 --> 03:04.840
If we take her to the hospital,

91
03:04.960 --> 03:06.280
won't they know we did it?

92
03:06.759 --> 03:07.479
What do we do then?

93
03:07.599 --> 03:08.520
We just won the bid on the factory.

94
03:08.520 --> 03:09.439
Nothing can happen to the factory.

95
03:09.439 --> 03:09.960
Then what do we do?

96
03:11.000 --> 03:12.439
How about we take her home?

97
03:12.639 --> 03:13.599
Do you even know where she lives?

98
03:13.639 --> 03:14.319
"Take her home"?

99
03:14.599 --> 03:15.439
Then what else can we do?

100
03:15.520 --> 03:16.400
What do we do, Boss?

101
03:19.000 --> 03:19.879
Say something!

102
03:19.879 --> 03:20.400
What do we do?

103
03:20.439 --> 03:21.520
You make the call!

104
03:21.919 --> 03:23.159
Take her back where she came from.

105
03:23.319 --> 03:23.719
Right, right, right.

106
03:23.719 --> 03:24.159
Okay, okay, okay.

107
03:25.479 --> 03:26.039
Get her...

108
03:26.280 --> 03:27.080
Lift, lift, lift!

109
03:27.120 --> 03:27.719
Okay, into the car!

110
03:51.520 --> 03:52.120
Listen to me.

111
03:52.800 --> 03:53.520
In a bit,

112
03:53.879 --> 03:55.120
we put her back exactly the same.

113
03:55.120 --> 03:55.719
Got it?

114
03:56.000 --> 03:57.400
Just like she was before.

115
03:57.400 --> 03:59.120
Put her clothes on nice and neat.

116
03:59.120 --> 03:59.639
Understand?

117
03:59.680 --> 04:00.159
Got it.

118
04:00.319 --> 04:03.400
Whoever asks, we don't know a thing.

119
04:03.599 --> 04:04.719
We never saw her.

120
04:04.719 --> 04:05.319
You hear me?

121
04:05.599 --> 04:06.280
Drive faster.

122
04:06.400 --> 04:07.159
Go, go, go.

123
06:58.439 --> 06:59.439
Both master and apprentice confessed.

124
07:01.079 --> 07:02.519
Your voice is completely hoarse.

125
07:02.720 --> 07:03.360
Have some water first.

126
07:05.319 --> 07:06.480
Liu Tieping confessed.

127
07:06.560 --> 07:08.360
He said he committed all the crimes.

128
07:08.519 --> 07:10.560
And in that basement of the old brewery,

129
07:10.639 --> 07:12.480
they found Feiyun-brand snow boots.

130
07:12.480 --> 07:13.360
Size 45.

131
07:13.720 --> 07:15.680
And the shoeprint at Qian Yichuan's crime scene,

132
07:15.720 --> 07:16.519
it's an exact match.

133
07:16.519 --> 07:18.279
So the chain of evidence is complete.

134
07:18.480 --> 07:19.480
But as for Cheng Youtian,

135
07:19.519 --> 07:21.519
I think he wants to protect his apprentice,

136
07:21.879 --> 07:23.480
so he insists he did everything himself.

137
07:25.399 --> 07:26.600
What about the beer bottle caps?

138
07:28.959 --> 07:29.560
He said he tossed them.

139
07:30.240 --> 07:31.079
Tossed them where?

140
07:31.439 --> 07:32.199
He said he forgot.

141
07:33.040 --> 07:34.040
Forgot?

142
07:36.199 --> 07:39.279
Shen Leshui, Liu Tieping, and Liu Xiaosheng...

143
07:39.319 --> 07:40.680
all three of them, without exception,

144
07:40.720 --> 07:41.560
mentioned a sum of money.

145
07:42.399 --> 07:44.040
Liu Tieping said

146
07:44.399 --> 07:45.800
he learned from Ma Guowen that

147
07:46.160 --> 07:48.120
on December 31, 1999,

148
07:48.480 --> 07:50.439
Ma Guowen gave Liu Xuemei some money.

149
07:50.600 --> 07:51.560
200,000 in cash.

150
07:51.759 --> 07:54.120
Yet the money's whereabouts are still unknown.

151
07:54.399 --> 07:56.199
Liu Tieping said his biggest regret

152
07:56.439 --> 07:57.319
was acting on impulse

153
07:57.319 --> 07:58.759
and killing Ma Guowen right then and there,

154
07:59.000 --> 08:00.199
without getting a confession out of him.

155
08:00.920 --> 08:02.160
Liu Xiaosheng claimed

156
08:02.160 --> 08:03.360
he never saw that money.

157
08:06.759 --> 08:07.720
Earlier,

158
08:08.079 --> 08:08.920
Shen Leshui mentioned

159
08:08.920 --> 08:10.279
back on the day of the auction,

160
08:10.279 --> 08:11.800
she did see Liu Xuemei

161
08:11.800 --> 08:13.839
carrying a bulging plaid cloth bag.

162
08:13.959 --> 08:15.600
Yet at the scene of the death,

163
08:15.600 --> 08:16.399
that bag was nowhere to be found.

164
08:16.839 --> 08:18.279
I checked the case files from back then,

165
08:18.279 --> 08:19.800
and the bag definitely wasn't at the scene.

166
08:21.079 --> 08:22.319
Liu Xiaosheng said

167
08:22.560 --> 08:24.839
the last time he saw Liu Xuemei,

168
08:25.160 --> 08:26.279
he didn't see the bag either.

169
08:26.399 --> 08:27.519
Liu Tieping suspected

170
08:27.600 --> 08:29.720
that Shen Leshui took the 200,000 yuan.

171
08:29.839 --> 08:31.519
Shen Leshui insists she didn't take it.

172
08:33.200 --> 08:34.399
So the 200,000 just vanished into thin air?

173
08:34.399 --> 08:35.000
Right?

174
08:37.000 --> 08:37.840
Right now,

175
08:38.240 --> 08:40.159
just as we're getting somewhere on the serial killings,

176
08:40.559 --> 08:41.759
a theft case pops up out of nowhere.

177
08:42.600 --> 08:43.960
Your old classmate said

178
08:44.480 --> 08:46.399
she has to track down that money,

179
08:46.519 --> 08:48.080
or she won't leave Lacheng.

180
08:52.200 --> 08:53.799
Tell her to stay out of trouble.

181
08:54.919 --> 08:56.039
Don't make a mess of things.

182
08:57.320 --> 08:58.559
We'll look into this.

183
09:03.360 --> 09:04.840
Even a poor home holds a fortune.

184
09:05.000 --> 09:05.559
I mean,

185
09:06.240 --> 09:07.200
the moment you talk about moving,

186
09:07.879 --> 09:10.159
all the bags and bundles come pouring out.

187
09:16.759 --> 09:18.080
Why are you just standing there?

188
09:18.080 --> 09:19.120
Come help me.

189
09:20.639 --> 09:21.200
Mom.

190
09:23.240 --> 09:24.279
Did you...

191
09:24.960 --> 09:25.879
lose a bag?

192
09:29.200 --> 09:31.120
I'd used that bag for over ten years.

193
09:31.159 --> 09:31.679
It's fine.

194
09:32.320 --> 09:33.440
You know that thief?

195
09:33.679 --> 09:34.759
It's so bizarre.

196
09:35.320 --> 09:36.120
They took the bag,

197
09:36.120 --> 09:37.120
but my wallet...

198
09:37.240 --> 09:37.919
left it right there.

199
09:41.240 --> 09:42.039
That bag...

200
09:42.480 --> 09:43.600
how did you get it?

201
09:43.919 --> 09:44.840
Found it.

202
09:45.279 --> 09:46.240
Where did you find it?

203
09:47.519 --> 09:48.440
In the trash can.

204
09:48.879 --> 09:49.799
Which trash can?

205
09:49.919 --> 09:50.480
Downstairs.

206
09:52.279 --> 09:53.200
When was this?

207
09:53.960 --> 09:56.360
That snowy day back then.

208
09:57.919 --> 09:58.960
The millennium...

209
09:59.559 --> 10:00.639
Winter of 2000.

210
10:02.440 --> 10:03.360
Who threw it away?

211
10:03.960 --> 10:04.720
Haipeng.

212
10:07.080 --> 10:08.120
Zhao Haipeng?

213
10:10.399 --> 10:11.240
Yeah, Haipeng.

214
10:11.720 --> 10:12.840
That spendthrift.

215
10:14.480 --> 10:15.679
When you picked up that bag,

216
10:15.679 --> 10:16.799
was it empty?

217
10:18.120 --> 10:19.879
Would he dare throw it out if there was stuff in it?

218
10:23.120 --> 10:23.759
Mom.

219
10:24.559 --> 10:24.960
Mom.

220
10:25.120 --> 10:26.000
Could you, could you...

221
10:26.039 --> 10:26.879
tell me about it?

222
10:26.879 --> 10:27.679
What really happened?

223
10:27.799 --> 10:29.399
Like, Zhao Haipeng...

224
10:29.480 --> 10:31.320
How did he bring the bag over?

225
10:31.759 --> 10:32.679
When he showed up,

226
10:32.679 --> 10:33.919
was there anything inside it?

227
10:34.320 --> 10:35.279
Think carefully.

228
10:36.080 --> 10:38.000
It's been so many years.

229
10:38.000 --> 10:39.240
Why are you suddenly asking about it,

230
10:39.240 --> 10:40.600
going on and on?

231
10:40.600 --> 10:41.960
Just help me think back.

232
10:42.480 --> 10:43.720
What really happened that day?

233
10:43.840 --> 10:45.200
How did he bring the bag over?

234
10:47.879 --> 10:49.840
Well, he came the night before,

235
10:51.000 --> 10:52.159
came again in the morning,

236
10:52.639 --> 10:53.279
and came again at noon.

237
10:53.279 --> 10:54.080
So I asked him.

238
10:54.399 --> 10:55.840
I said, "Why are you here again?"

239
10:57.639 --> 10:58.639
When I saw him come,

240
10:58.840 --> 11:00.000
I went out to buy some bean paste.

241
11:00.360 --> 11:01.519
Wanted to make him some...

242
11:01.960 --> 11:02.759
meat sauce.

243
11:02.799 --> 11:04.519
Mom, get to the point.

244
11:04.759 --> 11:06.120
Wasn't I out buying paste?

245
11:06.200 --> 11:07.039
And then?

246
11:07.279 --> 11:08.559
Then I bought minced meat,

247
11:09.480 --> 11:09.960
and the paste.

248
11:09.960 --> 11:11.399
Get to the point. Aren't you—

249
11:12.240 --> 11:12.600
No...

250
11:12.600 --> 11:14.480
What is the point?

251
11:14.759 --> 11:15.960
Zhao Haipeng.

252
11:16.320 --> 11:17.080
When he arrived,

253
11:17.080 --> 11:18.440
was he carrying that bag?

254
11:19.440 --> 11:20.759
When he arrived...

255
11:21.720 --> 11:22.480
Oh, right.

256
11:22.840 --> 11:24.519
Wasn't he wearing that overcoat?

257
11:24.519 --> 11:25.120
Just like this,

258
11:25.759 --> 11:26.399
bundled up,

259
11:26.759 --> 11:27.799
all hunched over.

260
11:29.559 --> 11:31.759
But I didn't see anything on him.

261
11:34.360 --> 11:35.440
Then why did you say

262
11:35.639 --> 11:37.559
he threw the bag in the trash?

263
11:37.919 --> 11:39.600
Wasn't I walking back from buying paste?

264
11:39.799 --> 11:41.120
I'd also bought minced meat.

265
11:41.519 --> 11:43.639
When I got back, I saw Zhao Haipeng

266
11:43.840 --> 11:44.759
take that bag,

267
11:44.759 --> 11:45.519
and toward the trash can,

268
11:45.639 --> 11:46.399
bam, tossed it right in!

269
11:46.399 --> 11:47.679
Then he rode off on his bicycle.

270
11:48.440 --> 11:49.320
So I figured

271
11:49.399 --> 11:50.480
he was throwing out my stuff,

272
11:50.480 --> 11:50.960
right?

273
11:51.320 --> 11:52.519
So I ran over to the trash can,

274
11:52.519 --> 11:53.399
fished it out, and saw

275
11:54.519 --> 11:55.960
the bag was still pretty new.

276
11:56.159 --> 11:56.759
Then I thought

277
11:56.759 --> 11:58.360
you must've disliked it,

278
11:58.360 --> 11:58.960
right?

279
11:59.200 --> 12:00.480
So I used it for groceries.

280
12:00.600 --> 12:01.320
Worked great.

281
12:10.039 --> 12:11.039
Are you okay?

282
12:15.480 --> 12:16.440
N-No, I'm fine.

283
12:20.200 --> 12:20.879
Mom.

284
12:22.360 --> 12:24.080
Haipeng and I...

285
12:24.960 --> 12:26.159
all these years since we split,

286
12:27.120 --> 12:29.320
has he been visiting you often?

287
12:29.559 --> 12:30.080
Yeah.

288
12:30.759 --> 12:32.559
Right up until he remarried,

289
12:33.080 --> 12:34.399
he was always dropping by.

290
12:34.480 --> 12:35.279
I figured

291
12:35.399 --> 12:37.080
he definitely wanted to get back with you.

292
12:37.080 --> 12:37.840
Right?

293
12:38.759 --> 12:39.480
And remember that year

294
12:39.480 --> 12:41.039
when my heart condition flared up?

295
12:41.440 --> 12:42.799
If it hadn't been for Haipeng,

296
12:42.919 --> 12:43.480
honestly,

297
12:43.480 --> 12:44.919
I wouldn't be alive today.

298
12:45.440 --> 12:46.879
Right, I told you about that.

299
12:49.279 --> 12:50.440
I've always believed

300
12:52.159 --> 12:53.320
he's a good man.

301
12:53.480 --> 12:54.120
He is.

302
12:54.840 --> 12:56.799
Haipeng really is a good boy.

303
12:58.399 --> 13:00.480
No matter what happened, big or small,

304
13:01.120 --> 13:03.080
he was always there helping out.

305
13:03.679 --> 13:04.399
Right?

306
13:04.759 --> 13:05.919
More attentive than you ever were.

307
13:06.200 --> 13:08.279
Whether proposing or divorcing...

308
13:11.240 --> 13:11.799
Hold still.

309
13:11.840 --> 13:12.399
I know, I know.

310
13:12.440 --> 13:13.159
Wait, that hurts!

311
13:13.200 --> 13:14.480
Ow, ow, ow!

312
13:17.200 --> 13:19.320
Why are there still glass shards in your hair?

313
13:22.200 --> 13:23.320
Does it need stitches?

314
13:23.960 --> 13:25.399
You don't really have to get stitches.

315
13:29.240 --> 13:30.159
Maybe just a couple of stitches?

316
13:30.399 --> 13:31.399
Stitches are fine,

317
13:31.559 --> 13:33.639
but we'll have to shave all the hair around here.

318
13:34.279 --> 13:34.919
No stitches, then.

319
13:41.600 --> 13:42.679
Don't move now.

320
13:42.919 --> 13:43.559
Bear with it.

321
13:45.480 --> 13:46.120
How are you doing?

322
13:46.960 --> 13:47.799
Does it hurt a lot?

323
13:48.080 --> 13:48.799
I'm fine. It doesn't hurt.

324
13:52.000 --> 13:53.000
It's all my fault today.

325
13:53.480 --> 13:54.440
I dragged you into this.

326
13:54.840 --> 13:56.879
Come on, what does it have to do with you?

327
13:58.039 --> 13:58.879
Besides, I...

328
14:00.759 --> 14:01.279
well...

329
14:01.919 --> 14:03.360
As someone in Security...

330
14:03.360 --> 14:03.840
wait, no,

331
14:04.519 --> 14:05.519
as someone in Publicity,

332
14:05.519 --> 14:06.879
protecting the equipment—

333
14:06.879 --> 14:08.120
isn't that just my duty?

334
14:11.440 --> 14:13.279
You saved my video camera.

335
14:13.759 --> 14:15.840
How can I ever thank you?

336
14:17.519 --> 14:18.799
Let me buy you hot pot.

337
14:19.279 --> 14:20.600
I should be the one treating you.

338
14:21.279 --> 14:21.879
Right.

339
14:22.559 --> 14:23.480
Fair enough.

340
14:24.240 --> 14:24.720
Sounds like a plan.

341
14:26.000 --> 14:26.639
Mom.

342
14:26.960 --> 14:28.480
Could you help me out a little more?

343
14:29.120 --> 14:30.639
I need to buy some more tapes.

344
14:31.159 --> 14:32.879
Didn't you just buy some a few days ago?

345
14:33.879 --> 14:35.240
I've already used them up.

346
14:37.720 --> 14:39.639
Go ask the TV station for support, then.

347
14:41.000 --> 14:44.039
Xiao Miao already snuck me three tapes.

348
14:44.440 --> 14:46.080
Any more and she won't be able to explain it.

349
14:46.120 --> 14:46.519
Come on,

350
14:46.519 --> 14:48.240
where am I supposed to get that kind of money?

351
14:50.919 --> 14:51.919
Mom, look,

352
14:52.120 --> 14:53.120
consider it a loan.

353
14:53.480 --> 14:55.080
I'll definitely pay you back once I make money.

354
14:55.639 --> 14:58.480
These next few days are the most crucial.

355
14:58.799 --> 15:00.960
I can't go into battle without ammunition, can I?

356
15:01.879 --> 15:02.799
How much do you need?

357
15:05.200 --> 15:07.240
Let's get 15 tapes this time.

358
15:07.960 --> 15:09.600
Wait, didn't you just say ten?

359
15:09.639 --> 15:11.200
Why are there five more now?

360
15:11.279 --> 15:12.279
Are you eating these tapes?

361
15:12.679 --> 15:13.759
Mom.

362
15:14.200 --> 15:16.039
This subject is too rare.

363
15:16.360 --> 15:17.519
If I miss this chance,

364
15:17.519 --> 15:19.320
I might never get a second chance in my life.

365
15:19.679 --> 15:21.519
Once it's gone, it's gone!

366
15:21.960 --> 15:23.399
Come on, are you shaking me down?

367
15:24.080 --> 15:25.440
You expect me to sell everything I own?

368
15:25.840 --> 15:26.919
Mom, you're the best.

369
15:26.919 --> 15:28.600
I knew you'd help me out.

370
15:28.600 --> 15:29.159
Don't worry.

371
15:29.159 --> 15:30.679
As soon as I make money, I'll pay you right back!

372
15:47.360 --> 15:48.159
Reporter Shen.

373
15:48.240 --> 15:49.080
Here!

374
15:49.159 --> 15:49.720
Coming!

375
15:50.559 --> 15:51.519
Go ahead, sing, sing!

376
15:51.559 --> 15:52.039
Sing already!

377
15:52.720 --> 15:53.720
Sing! Come on, sing!

378
15:53.759 --> 15:54.320
Where's everyone?

379
15:56.240 --> 15:56.759
Where is everybody?

380
15:56.840 --> 15:57.200
Coming!

381
15:57.200 --> 15:58.120
Xiao Shen, didn't you say 6:30?

382
15:58.320 --> 15:59.080
You're the only one here.

383
15:59.159 --> 15:59.720
Sister Chunyan.

384
15:59.799 --> 16:00.759
Coming, coming!

385
16:00.759 --> 16:01.399
Aren't we right here?

386
16:01.399 --> 16:01.960
Old Cheng!

387
16:02.000 --> 16:02.799
What are you dawdling for?

388
16:02.799 --> 16:03.559
You said 6:30.

389
16:03.840 --> 16:05.080
You office folks

390
16:05.120 --> 16:06.120
sure have it comfortable!

391
16:06.200 --> 16:06.840
Hurry up.

392
16:06.960 --> 16:07.639
Meeting time. Thanks, Sister Xuemei.

393
16:07.639 --> 16:08.200
Xuemei.

394
16:09.879 --> 16:10.279
Here.

395
16:10.279 --> 16:11.320
Reporter Shen, I'm here to serve you guys.

396
16:11.799 --> 16:12.240
Morning.

397
16:12.399 --> 16:13.320
Thanks.

398
16:13.600 --> 16:14.039
Here, take one.

399
16:14.200 --> 16:14.720
Quick.

400
16:14.879 --> 16:15.639
Where's Haipeng?

401
16:16.519 --> 16:17.679
Why isn't Zhao Haipeng here?

402
16:20.919 --> 16:21.720
Sister Xuemei is here.

403
16:27.159 --> 16:27.720
Hey, Haipeng.

404
16:30.639 --> 16:31.600
Look at you.

405
16:31.720 --> 16:32.320
Heading into battle,

406
16:32.320 --> 16:33.559
you can't go without ammo.

407
16:36.120 --> 16:36.639
Here.

408
16:40.759 --> 16:41.840
Where did you get this?

409
16:42.440 --> 16:43.600
I have connections in Lacheng.

410
16:44.360 --> 16:45.080
Had someone get it for me.

411
16:45.600 --> 16:46.559
What connections?

412
16:46.879 --> 16:48.000
You just bought it.

413
16:48.080 --> 16:48.840
What?

414
16:48.879 --> 16:49.480
What?

415
16:49.600 --> 16:50.480
Section Chief Zhao

416
16:50.679 --> 16:51.519
sold his TV,

417
16:51.960 --> 16:53.080
sold his motorcycle too.

418
16:53.879 --> 16:54.679
Spent all that money,

419
16:54.679 --> 16:56.200
and didn't even want anyone to know.

420
16:56.759 --> 16:58.519
I shouldn't have let you know.

421
16:58.919 --> 16:59.480
Come on, Director Cheng,

422
16:59.480 --> 17:00.960
why do you run your mouth so much?

423
17:02.000 --> 17:03.639
Why don't you head to the broadcast room

424
17:03.639 --> 17:04.640
and give a speech?

425
17:06.000 --> 17:07.119
College boy, don't listen to his nonsense.

426
17:07.839 --> 17:08.799
Write up a draft!

427
17:09.240 --> 17:10.720
Let's teach Section Chief Zhao

428
17:11.039 --> 17:12.200
how to pick up girls!

429
17:13.039 --> 17:14.039
Learn what from you?

430
17:14.039 --> 17:15.480
Learn how to stay a bachelor?

431
17:15.680 --> 17:16.000
Right!

432
17:16.000 --> 17:17.519
You haven't even figured it out yourself!

433
17:18.039 --> 17:18.559
Come on, stop...

434
17:18.559 --> 17:19.079
Chuan, Chuan!

435
17:19.119 --> 17:20.359
You're a real pal!

436
17:20.920 --> 17:21.680
Off you go!

437
17:22.839 --> 17:23.440
Listen, listen...

438
17:23.440 --> 17:24.960
Leshui, don't listen to their racket.

439
17:25.839 --> 17:26.960
Here's how I see it.

440
17:27.680 --> 17:29.640
We recruited Leshui ourselves,

441
17:29.680 --> 17:30.440
right?

442
17:30.519 --> 17:32.240
Getting some tapes for the Publicity Section,

443
17:32.240 --> 17:33.440
isn't that totally normal?

444
17:33.519 --> 17:34.119
Spot on.

445
17:34.319 --> 17:34.960
Besides,

446
17:35.000 --> 17:36.359
that TV was just sitting there.

447
17:36.440 --> 17:38.119
Nothing good was on lately anyway.

448
17:38.160 --> 17:39.319
It was just gathering dust there.

449
17:39.400 --> 17:39.839
Right?

450
17:40.079 --> 17:41.960
And that motorcycle was a real gas guzzler.

451
17:42.240 --> 17:42.799
Old Zhao...

452
17:44.039 --> 17:45.839
Wait, so you knew it guzzled gas?

453
17:46.079 --> 17:47.599
Then—then you forced it on me!

454
17:47.759 --> 17:48.119
Tieping...

455
17:48.119 --> 17:49.039
You even... you even threatened me!

456
17:49.039 --> 17:49.680
It's a great ride, though!

457
17:49.680 --> 17:50.680
Great ride? You even threatened me, saying

458
17:50.680 --> 17:51.000
if I didn't buy it,

459
17:51.000 --> 17:52.119
- you'd cut ties! - I kept it so well!

460
17:52.160 --> 17:52.880
Give me a break!

461
17:52.880 --> 17:53.720
This cost hundreds!

462
17:53.720 --> 17:54.839
Such bull! He even borrowed money from you!

463
17:54.839 --> 17:55.759
- You shoot it. - It's over 200 a tape!

464
17:56.200 --> 17:57.240
Over 200 a tape!

465
17:57.240 --> 17:58.039
He must be up to his eyeballs in debt!

466
17:58.319 --> 17:59.400
- What did you think? - You really did it.

467
17:59.759 --> 18:00.319
All right, all right, all right.

468
18:00.359 --> 18:01.000
Keep it down.

469
18:01.039 --> 18:01.799
He's trying to work here.

470
18:03.960 --> 18:04.640
Is it turned on?

471
18:06.559 --> 18:07.359
Can you see clearly?

472
18:11.359 --> 18:12.240
I'm Shen Leshui,

473
18:13.119 --> 18:14.079
a Lacheng local,

474
18:15.240 --> 18:16.039
just a

475
18:16.240 --> 18:16.920
small-time director,

476
18:17.160 --> 18:17.839
a rookie reporter.

477
18:19.279 --> 18:20.319
No family background,

478
18:20.880 --> 18:21.599
and no money.

479
18:23.400 --> 18:24.759
We ran out of tapes.

480
18:25.680 --> 18:26.279
What now?

481
18:29.079 --> 18:30.519
Luckily, someone stepped up to help.

482
18:30.759 --> 18:31.880
Who?

483
18:31.920 --> 18:32.960
Me!

484
18:33.759 --> 18:35.599
Who else?

485
18:36.160 --> 18:37.160
Zhao Haipeng.

486
18:38.079 --> 18:38.359
Come on.

487
18:38.359 --> 18:38.920
She's calling you.

488
18:39.039 --> 18:39.680
Call... calling you.

489
18:39.759 --> 18:40.480
She's calling you! Wait, what do I do?

490
18:40.519 --> 18:41.160
Hurry up!

491
18:41.240 --> 18:41.759
Wait, wait, wait.

492
18:42.160 --> 18:42.680
No, no, no.

493
18:42.720 --> 18:43.480
No, no, no.

494
18:43.480 --> 18:44.119
Leave me out—wait,

495
18:44.119 --> 18:44.680
leave me out of this.

496
18:44.680 --> 18:45.119
Speak up properly.

497
18:45.119 --> 18:45.960
These tapes are expensive.

498
18:45.960 --> 18:47.160
Th-this is such a waste. It's recording!

499
18:47.160 --> 18:47.759
It's recording.

500
18:47.759 --> 18:48.519
Hurry up and talk!

501
18:48.680 --> 18:49.200
Alright, alright, alright.

502
18:49.200 --> 18:49.759
Come on, come on.

503
18:51.160 --> 18:51.680
Ms. Shen,

504
18:52.039 --> 18:52.599
ask away.

505
18:54.680 --> 18:55.960
All those new tapes,

506
18:56.200 --> 18:57.119
how did you get them?

507
18:58.279 --> 18:59.960
They must've cost quite a bit.

508
19:00.799 --> 19:02.119
Definitely didn't steal them.

509
19:02.119 --> 19:02.759
Well...

510
19:03.759 --> 19:04.920
here's how I see it.

511
19:05.039 --> 19:08.240
When money is spent on meaningful things,

512
19:08.240 --> 19:09.599
that's an honor for the money itself.

513
19:10.839 --> 19:11.680
Look at this kid.

514
19:12.839 --> 19:13.640
Smooth talker!

515
19:15.559 --> 19:16.799
Then why are you willing to help me?

516
19:18.359 --> 19:19.960
Didn't I just say? Why ask?

517
19:20.000 --> 19:21.279
Because he likes you!

518
19:21.359 --> 19:23.119
Otherwise, why didn't he help me?

519
19:23.119 --> 19:24.440
What do you need tapes for anyway?

520
19:24.519 --> 19:25.759
Let me help, I'll tie a bow.

521
19:26.160 --> 19:26.839
Like this, like this, like this.

522
19:27.079 --> 19:27.799
Let's cut right to the chase,

523
19:27.880 --> 19:28.359
shall we?

524
19:28.480 --> 19:29.799
Just kiss her already!

525
19:29.920 --> 19:33.279
Kiss her! Kiss her!

526
19:33.359 --> 19:34.599
We're civilized folks. Kiss her!

527
19:34.680 --> 19:40.079
Kiss her! Kiss her! Kiss her!

528
20:07.920 --> 20:09.319
Now that the case is solved,

529
20:09.559 --> 20:11.799
Ms. Shen's in the mood to buy me dinner.

530
20:18.039 --> 20:18.720
What are we having?

531
20:19.279 --> 20:19.880
Hot pot.

532
20:21.599 --> 20:22.440
Hot pot, huh?

533
20:34.880 --> 20:37.160
Do you still remember our first meal?

534
20:39.240 --> 20:40.799
Xiaomei Hotpot.

535
20:42.079 --> 20:43.200
After that meal,

536
20:43.319 --> 20:45.359
our true revolutionary friendship began.

537
20:47.079 --> 20:48.079
And then?

538
20:48.559 --> 20:49.880
You went to Beijing to make your way,

539
20:50.759 --> 20:52.519
and I began my long wait.

540
20:54.519 --> 20:56.200
Only to end up with divorce papers.

541
20:57.200 --> 20:58.519
Hey, let's get the facts straight.

542
20:58.880 --> 21:00.880
You were the one who served me the papers.

543
21:01.519 --> 21:02.880
But you took them right away, didn't you?

544
21:04.960 --> 21:06.880
That's because I'm smart.

545
21:07.039 --> 21:07.839
Right?

546
21:08.279 --> 21:08.960
Here, give it to me.

547
21:10.559 --> 21:12.960
A wise man knows when to fold.

548
21:13.240 --> 21:13.880
You know?

549
21:14.279 --> 21:15.119
Making a scene and clinging on...

550
21:15.160 --> 21:16.000
I never do that.

551
21:18.400 --> 21:18.799
Cheers.

552
21:26.720 --> 21:27.960
The taste of Old Lapi Beer...

553
21:29.880 --> 21:31.559
I don't think it's as good as before.

554
21:32.160 --> 21:32.640
It's watered down.

555
21:38.920 --> 21:40.440
Signed the contract on this place yesterday.

556
21:44.000 --> 21:44.680
Nice.

557
21:45.920 --> 21:46.559
So it's sold.

558
21:48.480 --> 21:49.839
Saves me from worrying whenever it storms,

559
21:49.839 --> 21:50.960
about the roof leaking.

560
21:54.079 --> 21:55.079
Once I get the money,

561
21:55.799 --> 21:56.799
I'll square things with you.

562
21:59.359 --> 22:00.880
There you go again.

563
22:02.000 --> 22:04.079
Even close friends keep clean accounts.

564
22:06.599 --> 22:07.720
Honestly, Leshui,

565
22:09.119 --> 22:11.799
I was planning that when you remarry,

566
22:12.319 --> 22:13.480
I'd give you a huge gift.

567
22:14.519 --> 22:16.799
Back when the two of us tied the knot,

568
22:16.799 --> 22:18.200
we didn't even have a proper wedding.

569
22:19.160 --> 22:19.880
Stop right there.

570
22:21.559 --> 22:22.799
I'm doing just fine on my own.

571
22:23.880 --> 22:24.519
What's wrong?

572
22:24.920 --> 22:26.000
What rattled you?

573
22:27.319 --> 22:28.680
Who dumped you?

574
22:31.039 --> 22:32.279
I dumped myself.

575
22:35.000 --> 22:36.200
That's called making peace with yourself.

576
22:36.200 --> 22:36.880
You know that?

577
22:37.880 --> 22:39.480
Only those who've figured things out

578
22:39.799 --> 22:40.680
know how to make peace.

579
22:40.759 --> 22:41.960
People like me who haven't,

580
22:41.960 --> 22:43.359
you just stay stuck in endless turmoil,

581
22:43.880 --> 22:45.599
never grasping the truth of the universe.

582
22:47.039 --> 22:47.440
Come on.

583
22:48.440 --> 22:49.960
A toast to Ms. Shen, forty and doubt-free,

584
22:50.960 --> 22:53.079
seeing through everything under the sun.

585
22:56.119 --> 22:58.119
Seeing through everything?

586
22:58.440 --> 22:59.920
You'd have to live long enough to be a demon.

587
23:00.680 --> 23:02.720
I haven't even sorted out what's right before me.

588
23:03.240 --> 23:03.799
Really?

589
23:04.400 --> 23:05.119
Like what?

590
23:08.279 --> 23:09.119
Need to drink a bit more

591
23:09.319 --> 23:10.240
to have the guts to say it.

592
23:11.880 --> 23:12.480
Oh, man.

593
23:13.079 --> 23:13.680
Come on, let's go.

594
23:14.039 --> 23:14.720
I'll drink with you.

595
23:33.119 --> 23:33.920
Talk to me.

596
23:34.920 --> 23:36.000
What's weighing on your mind?

597
23:39.799 --> 23:41.119
Let me tell you,

598
23:41.400 --> 23:43.079
the past is in the past.

599
23:44.559 --> 23:45.039
Look,

600
23:45.599 --> 23:47.200
they caught everyone they were supposed to.

601
23:47.759 --> 23:48.319
Right?

602
23:50.240 --> 23:51.359
We've still got a long life ahead.

603
23:56.279 --> 23:56.640
Come on.

604
23:58.440 --> 23:59.160
At least...

605
24:00.200 --> 24:01.359
we're both still alive.

606
24:03.640 --> 24:04.400
Haipeng.

607
24:06.480 --> 24:07.720
Before we get drunk,

608
24:09.279 --> 24:10.599
I want to hear the truth.

609
24:13.880 --> 24:14.519
Go ahead.

610
24:20.160 --> 24:21.440
Do you remember

611
24:22.559 --> 24:24.319
that threatening letter I got back then?

612
24:25.839 --> 24:26.839
Of course I remember.

613
24:27.200 --> 24:28.839
It pissed me off so bad back then.

614
24:29.720 --> 24:31.640
That bastard still hasn't been found, right?

615
24:34.079 --> 24:35.599
Then do you remember

616
24:37.440 --> 24:39.519
what was written in that letter?

617
24:42.759 --> 24:45.319
"If you dare air the footage of the Lapi Brewery,

618
24:45.319 --> 24:46.240
you're dead."

619
24:48.000 --> 24:48.559
Right?

620
24:50.000 --> 24:51.599
Can you believe that bastard...

621
24:58.480 --> 24:59.480
Back then, I only told you

622
24:59.480 --> 25:00.720
that I got a threatening letter.

623
25:01.839 --> 25:02.960
But I never told you

624
25:03.279 --> 25:04.519
what was in the letter.

625
25:07.759 --> 25:09.559
How do you know it so clearly,

626
25:12.200 --> 25:13.640
word for word?

627
25:41.240 --> 25:43.079
I always thought that threatening letter

628
25:43.079 --> 25:44.279
was written by Chen Qingchun.

629
25:47.559 --> 25:48.359
I never imagined

630
25:51.720 --> 25:53.319
it was actually you, Zhao Haipeng.

631
26:28.799 --> 26:29.680
Surprised, aren't you?

632
26:31.880 --> 26:32.960
I really did write it.

633
26:36.559 --> 26:37.359
Back then,

634
26:37.920 --> 26:38.880
I was just thinking...

635
26:38.960 --> 26:40.880
All that footage you shot,

636
26:41.960 --> 26:43.480
those scenes of people causing trouble,

637
26:45.279 --> 26:47.160
do you think Ma Guowen would let you air it?

638
26:47.799 --> 26:50.200
Would your station leaders agree to air it?

639
26:50.680 --> 26:51.480
Even...

640
26:51.880 --> 26:52.720
Cheng Youtian...

641
26:53.160 --> 26:54.519
None of them agreed.

642
26:56.799 --> 26:58.720
But look at the state you were in back then.

643
26:59.559 --> 27:01.039
You were completely hyped up,

644
27:01.039 --> 27:02.079
and I couldn't stop you.

645
27:05.200 --> 27:06.559
I had no choice but to resort to this.

646
27:11.880 --> 27:13.400
Then after Ma Guowen died,

647
27:14.519 --> 27:15.799
what about that threatening letter?

648
27:24.240 --> 27:24.759
Look,

649
27:25.720 --> 27:26.720
all I wanted was

650
27:27.119 --> 27:28.519
to get you out of here quickly.

651
27:31.759 --> 27:32.880
I tried to convince you so many times,

652
27:33.519 --> 27:34.240
but you wouldn't listen.

653
27:34.759 --> 27:36.039
The state you were in back then

654
27:37.279 --> 27:38.640
was just like all those years ago.

655
27:41.000 --> 27:42.960
So I had to pull the same trick again.

656
27:43.920 --> 27:46.359
You just didn't want me to see the discarded footage.

657
27:48.880 --> 27:49.480
What the hell are you talking about?

658
27:51.960 --> 27:53.440
Because in that footage,

659
27:54.319 --> 27:55.200
lies your secret.

660
27:58.960 --> 28:00.720
What secret could I possibly have?

661
28:05.720 --> 28:07.240
You took Liu Xuemei's money.

662
28:13.400 --> 28:14.839
I told you before

663
28:18.000 --> 28:20.279
that I filmed Liu Xuemei outside the auction house,

664
28:21.319 --> 28:22.920
running out clutching a bag,

665
28:23.440 --> 28:24.440
stumbling,

666
28:25.319 --> 28:26.279
as if she were drunk.

667
28:29.680 --> 28:31.759
Right after you watched that clip with me,

668
28:32.920 --> 28:34.359
I received that threatening letter.

669
28:39.200 --> 28:42.039
If I had edited those shots in,

670
28:43.119 --> 28:45.160
someone would have noticed.

671
28:47.359 --> 28:48.079
Because when the police

672
28:48.079 --> 28:50.039
arrived at the scene of Liu Xuemei's death,

673
28:50.079 --> 28:51.559
there was no bag to be seen.

674
28:52.920 --> 28:53.920
So nobody knew

675
28:53.920 --> 28:56.119
that there was once a bag filled with cash.

676
28:57.079 --> 28:59.359
That's the secret you hid for over a decade.

677
29:04.880 --> 29:06.839
You took that money.

678
29:30.519 --> 29:30.960
Hello?

679
29:31.079 --> 29:32.160
It's Zhao Haipeng from Publicity.

680
29:33.200 --> 29:33.920
Sister Xuemei,

681
29:35.480 --> 29:36.279
where are you?

682
30:04.240 --> 30:05.000
Zhao Haipeng!

683
30:07.799 --> 30:08.559
Zhao Haipeng!

684
30:11.039 --> 30:12.039
What are you doing here?

685
30:12.759 --> 30:13.559
Quick, quick, quick!

686
30:14.640 --> 30:15.200
Hurry!

687
30:15.200 --> 30:16.240
Come on, hurry, hurry!

688
30:17.880 --> 30:19.640
Wait, how much did you drink?

689
30:20.319 --> 30:22.079
You never drink!

690
30:22.319 --> 30:22.839
You... you...

691
30:23.240 --> 30:24.839
Who forced you to drink like this?

692
30:26.119 --> 30:26.559
By the way...

693
30:26.799 --> 30:27.279
Tell me...

694
30:27.839 --> 30:29.559
Why didn't you go to the auction?

695
30:29.720 --> 30:30.839
Someone sold us out.

696
30:31.119 --> 30:32.799
Ma Guowen knew all along that I was going.

697
30:33.200 --> 30:35.200
The second I arrived, I was cornered.

698
30:40.519 --> 30:41.359
Liu Xuemei.

699
30:41.960 --> 30:42.960
Director Ma is waiting for you.

700
30:44.759 --> 30:45.680
I have to get to the auction.

701
30:46.960 --> 30:48.240
Talk to Director Ma first.

702
30:48.799 --> 30:49.240
Move.

703
30:49.519 --> 30:50.559
I have to go to the auction! Let go!

704
30:50.920 --> 30:52.200
Talk after you see Director Ma.

705
30:52.200 --> 30:53.400
What are you doing?!

706
30:54.200 --> 30:54.799
Let go!

707
30:54.799 --> 30:55.319
Move!

708
30:56.599 --> 30:57.160
Then...

709
30:58.039 --> 31:00.200
he dragged me into a restaurant nearby.

710
31:00.359 --> 31:01.200
Someone was guarding the door.

711
31:01.440 --> 31:02.440
I couldn't get out at all.

712
31:03.920 --> 31:04.279
He...

713
31:04.759 --> 31:05.920
He pulled out 20,000 yuan,

714
31:06.079 --> 31:07.119
trying to shut me up.

715
31:14.599 --> 31:15.079
Wait here.

716
31:15.720 --> 31:16.920
The factory beauty lives around here, right?

717
31:17.440 --> 31:18.319
How should I know?

718
31:18.480 --> 31:20.240
What the hell are we looking for in this freezing cold?

719
31:20.440 --> 31:21.119
Just look when you're told to.

720
31:21.160 --> 31:22.119
Quit the damn whining.

721
31:22.160 --> 31:22.960
Quit arguing!

722
31:22.960 --> 31:23.920
You're distracting me from driving.

723
31:24.200 --> 31:25.359
Check up ahead. Look ahead.

724
31:25.359 --> 31:26.200
Over here!

725
31:26.440 --> 31:27.160
Slow down, slow down, slow down.

726
31:28.440 --> 31:29.559
Check up ahead. Look ahead.

727
31:30.079 --> 31:31.240
Where the hell is it?

728
31:35.079 --> 31:35.720
There's nothing here.

729
31:42.640 --> 31:45.039
I drank glass after glass to get this money.

730
31:45.480 --> 31:46.319
10,000 yuan a glass.

731
31:46.640 --> 31:48.759
I just wanted to get as much as I could.

732
31:48.960 --> 31:49.640
This... this...

733
31:49.640 --> 31:50.720
How much money is this?

734
31:52.160 --> 31:53.359
Exactly 200,000 yuan.

735
31:54.519 --> 31:55.119
I kept thinking...

736
31:55.480 --> 31:57.119
this is all our workers' money.

737
31:57.559 --> 31:58.599
We couldn't let him get away with it.

738
32:02.720 --> 32:04.000
Until the auction started,

739
32:04.160 --> 32:05.440
and I really couldn't drink anymore.

740
32:05.720 --> 32:06.880
That bastard Ma Guowen,

741
32:07.519 --> 32:08.440
he had evil intentions.

742
32:09.039 --> 32:10.119
He thought I was completely hammered.

743
32:10.480 --> 32:11.960
He planned to come back

744
32:12.640 --> 32:13.920
after the auction ended.

745
32:14.240 --> 32:15.319
He wanted to assault me.

746
32:15.799 --> 32:16.960
He thought I was dead drunk.

747
32:17.599 --> 32:18.480
Even though my legs gave out,

748
32:18.759 --> 32:19.839
my head was still clear.

749
32:20.559 --> 32:21.119
As soon as he left,

750
32:21.359 --> 32:22.240
I ran for it.

751
32:23.480 --> 32:24.880
I couldn't reach the finance office by phone.

752
32:25.359 --> 32:26.440
There were too many people in the workshop.

753
32:26.880 --> 32:28.039
You're the only one I could turn to.

754
32:30.079 --> 32:30.640
Take it.

755
32:30.920 --> 32:32.119
Why... why are you giving this to me?

756
32:33.079 --> 32:34.359
I haven't told a soul about this.

757
32:35.119 --> 32:36.319
Hurry up and take this money,

758
32:36.599 --> 32:37.720
and hide it somewhere safe.

759
32:38.799 --> 32:39.559
In all my life...

760
32:39.960 --> 32:40.279
I...

761
32:40.559 --> 32:41.960
I've never seen this much money.

762
32:42.880 --> 32:44.519
The thing is, where do I even hide it?

763
32:45.000 --> 32:46.039
Never mind where!

764
32:46.559 --> 32:47.920
The most important thing is to hide it!

765
32:48.200 --> 32:50.000
Ma Guowen knows where I live,

766
32:50.200 --> 32:51.000
right in this neighborhood.

767
32:51.319 --> 32:52.480
He won't let this go.

768
32:52.720 --> 32:53.599
You must hide it well.

769
32:54.039 --> 32:54.839
First thing tomorrow morning,

770
32:54.960 --> 32:56.119
we'll go find Director Cheng

771
32:56.319 --> 32:56.920
and see...

772
32:57.000 --> 32:58.000
how to distribute this money.

773
32:59.119 --> 33:01.119
I want to give this money back to those workers

774
33:01.799 --> 33:02.680
who chipped in to buy the factory,

775
33:03.000 --> 33:04.160
but feared retaliation

776
33:04.359 --> 33:05.880
and were afraid to claim their investment.

777
33:06.079 --> 33:06.880
Right, right, right.

778
33:07.480 --> 33:07.880
Right.

779
33:08.440 --> 33:09.000
Then... then...

780
33:09.759 --> 33:11.599
Then let me write you a receipt.

781
33:11.880 --> 33:12.759
Forget the receipt!

782
33:12.920 --> 33:13.880
There's no time for that!

783
33:14.000 --> 33:14.599
Just get out of here.

784
33:14.720 --> 33:15.640
Hurry and hide the money!

785
33:16.200 --> 33:16.720
Okay, okay.

786
33:17.200 --> 33:17.680
Go, hurry!

787
33:17.759 --> 33:18.160
Okay, okay.

788
33:18.160 --> 33:18.720
I trust you.

789
33:18.880 --> 33:19.480
Hurry up!

790
33:20.279 --> 33:21.400
See you at the publicity section tomorrow.

791
33:23.759 --> 33:24.240
Okay, okay.

792
33:24.359 --> 33:24.799
Go!

793
33:24.880 --> 33:25.640
See you tomorrow!

794
33:26.960 --> 33:28.279
Okay, okay, okay.

795
34:25.159 --> 34:26.039
Coming!

796
34:29.039 --> 34:29.679
Haipeng.

797
34:29.719 --> 34:30.239
Auntie.

798
34:30.440 --> 34:31.559
What brings you by?

799
34:32.239 --> 34:33.039
Where's Leshui?

800
34:33.360 --> 34:35.360
Isn't Leshui working late at the TV station?

801
34:35.400 --> 34:36.039
It's Millennium Eve,

802
34:36.119 --> 34:36.800
so I came to check on you.

803
34:37.159 --> 34:38.280
Working late again...

804
34:38.440 --> 34:39.280
You haven't eaten, have you?

805
34:39.480 --> 34:40.199
Not yet.

806
34:40.280 --> 34:41.159
Perfect timing. I'll make you something.

807
34:41.320 --> 34:41.960
Sounds great.

808
34:42.559 --> 34:43.159
Go sit over there.

809
34:43.679 --> 34:43.960
Okay.

810
34:43.960 --> 34:44.400
Give me a minute.

811
34:44.400 --> 34:45.079
Alright, okay.

812
34:45.800 --> 34:47.440
Anything warm will do, Auntie.

813
34:47.480 --> 34:48.079
Will do.

814
35:31.039 --> 35:31.760
Auntie.

815
35:32.719 --> 35:34.119
I heard they're setting off fireworks in People's Square.

816
35:34.119 --> 35:35.159
Aren't you going to watch?

817
35:36.199 --> 35:37.239
I'll pass.

818
35:37.239 --> 35:38.280
You young folks go have fun.

819
35:38.280 --> 35:39.119
Go with Leshui.

820
35:39.440 --> 35:40.320
All right, I'll go with Leshui then.

821
35:40.480 --> 35:41.320
Come back for dinner, okay?

822
35:41.639 --> 35:42.280
Come back and eat.

823
35:42.320 --> 35:42.719
Okay.

824
35:43.280 --> 35:44.280
I'm heading out now.

825
35:45.639 --> 35:46.400
Watch your step.

826
35:46.400 --> 35:47.159
Don't worry.

827
35:48.079 --> 35:49.079
Come back for dinner!

828
36:16.360 --> 36:16.920
Froze to death.

829
36:17.880 --> 36:18.840
It's a woman.

830
36:19.360 --> 36:20.039
Froze to death.

831
36:22.079 --> 36:23.320
Sir! Sir!

832
36:25.000 --> 36:25.679
What is it?

833
36:26.800 --> 36:28.079
Don't believe or spread rumors.

834
36:32.480 --> 36:33.039
Leshui.

835
36:40.599 --> 36:41.480
Liu Xuemei.

836
36:42.880 --> 36:43.400
What about her?

837
36:45.000 --> 36:47.519
The victim is Liu Xuemei.

838
36:57.119 --> 36:59.280
Director Ma is here with the security team.

839
37:00.079 --> 37:01.559
Do you want to head back to the factory first?

840
37:07.880 --> 37:08.400
Got it.

841
37:08.760 --> 37:09.639
I'm heading out.

842
37:27.320 --> 37:28.159
Something terrible happened.

843
37:28.360 --> 37:28.840
What's wrong?

844
37:29.400 --> 37:30.880
Liu Xuemei is dead.

845
37:31.159 --> 37:32.119
Don't cry yet.

846
37:32.679 --> 37:33.880
Because she's a traitor.

847
37:34.519 --> 37:36.280
She didn't even go to the auction.

848
37:36.280 --> 37:37.599
Ma Guowen gave her a huge sum of money.

849
37:37.639 --> 37:38.320
She took the cash and ran,

850
37:38.360 --> 37:39.440
and karma caught up with her.

851
37:39.679 --> 37:40.280
She's dead.

852
37:40.920 --> 37:41.719
But the problem is,

853
37:42.079 --> 37:43.000
she's dead,

854
37:43.360 --> 37:44.400
so where did the money go?

855
37:44.639 --> 37:45.360
Are you stupid?

856
37:45.840 --> 37:47.119
Someone killed her for the money!

857
37:50.639 --> 37:51.800
Who told you that?

858
37:52.000 --> 37:53.400
I heard it from Ma Guowen.

859
37:53.559 --> 37:54.840
It's all over the factory floor.

860
37:55.119 --> 37:56.239
You actually believe him?

861
37:56.280 --> 37:56.920
I don't believe his words,

862
37:56.920 --> 37:57.639
but I've got a brain.

863
37:57.880 --> 37:59.480
A woman with a child,

864
37:59.599 --> 38:00.960
with that much money in front of her...

865
38:01.000 --> 38:01.880
Who wouldn't be tempted?

866
38:02.079 --> 38:03.000
Could you resist?

867
38:07.079 --> 38:08.239
This is the meeting room.

868
38:08.360 --> 38:09.199
Ma Guowen is here.

869
38:09.199 --> 38:10.320
He brought the police with him.

870
38:14.199 --> 38:14.719
We're done for.

871
38:14.960 --> 38:15.840
They're questioning room by room.

872
38:16.039 --> 38:16.679
What do we do?

873
38:17.559 --> 38:18.599
What do you mean, "what do we do"?

874
38:19.239 --> 38:20.480
I didn't murder anyone for money.

875
38:20.480 --> 38:21.440
What do I have to be afraid of?

876
38:22.159 --> 38:23.480
Let them ask away.

877
38:25.719 --> 38:26.159
They're here! They're here!

878
38:26.199 --> 38:26.760
Hurry, let's go.

879
38:26.880 --> 38:27.880
This is the gatehouse.

880
38:28.039 --> 38:28.800
This is the security section.

881
38:29.079 --> 38:30.760
Behind these two is our section.

882
38:30.760 --> 38:31.400
The security section.

883
38:32.159 --> 38:32.679
Let's go.

884
38:35.079 --> 38:37.000
It's getting a bit late today.

885
38:39.239 --> 38:39.960
This is...

886
38:40.719 --> 38:42.119
the Women's Federation office.

887
38:42.800 --> 38:44.760
This is the deputy factory manager's office.

888
38:59.280 --> 39:00.920
It's getting pretty late today,

889
39:01.159 --> 39:01.679
but

890
39:01.960 --> 39:04.519
I'll round everyone up for you later, okay?

891
39:50.960 --> 39:53.039
I haven't told anyone about this.

892
39:53.440 --> 39:54.840
Make sure you find a safe place

893
39:55.039 --> 39:56.280
to hide this money.

894
40:09.960 --> 40:11.440
Ma Guowen won't just let this go.

895
40:11.599 --> 40:13.000
He'll definitely come back for me.

896
41:11.880 --> 41:12.800
Spendthrift.

897
41:32.719 --> 41:34.199
You really did hide the money

898
41:35.239 --> 41:37.039
in the safest place possible.

899
41:42.239 --> 41:43.719
No one would've ever guessed

900
41:44.760 --> 41:47.199
your true reason for never speaking ill

901
41:47.639 --> 41:48.800
of Liu Xuemei all these years.

902
41:51.920 --> 41:53.599
Because you were the only one who knew

903
41:54.880 --> 41:56.360
what kind of person she was.

904
41:59.800 --> 42:03.079
Yet you never once stepped forward to clear her name.

905
42:14.159 --> 42:15.400
Actually, I told them.

906
42:16.039 --> 42:17.960
I said Liu Xuemei wasn't that kind of person.

907
42:20.239 --> 42:21.559
But no one would listen to me.

908
42:22.880 --> 42:23.760
And no one believed me.

909
42:27.400 --> 42:29.519
If you had brought that money out

910
42:30.119 --> 42:31.599
and placed it before everyone,

911
42:32.000 --> 42:33.880
telling them what happened that night,

912
42:33.880 --> 42:35.719
would anyone still refuse to believe it?

913
42:38.280 --> 42:41.039
If Liu Tieping had known the truth,

914
42:42.199 --> 42:44.840
would he have done something so stupid?

915
42:46.239 --> 42:48.159
If Qian Yichuan had known the truth,

916
42:48.159 --> 42:50.159
would he have hurled such vile insults

917
42:50.280 --> 42:52.440
at such a kind-hearted woman?

918
42:55.039 --> 42:56.559
Every holiday,

919
42:57.679 --> 42:58.960
you threw money around,

920
42:59.079 --> 43:00.480
visiting the sick and the elderly.

921
43:03.400 --> 43:04.960
But did you ever tell them

922
43:04.960 --> 43:06.280
that this was the money Liu Xuemei

923
43:06.280 --> 43:08.039
fought so hard to get for them?

924
43:08.039 --> 43:10.280
That she drank glass after glass to get it?

925
43:13.199 --> 43:15.960
If she hadn't been forced to drink,

926
43:18.480 --> 43:20.079
she wouldn't have frozen to death.

927
43:21.719 --> 43:23.559
If she had known you'd turn out like this,

928
43:24.719 --> 43:26.719
she'd rather have gone to Cheng Youtian herself,

929
43:26.719 --> 43:28.199
and she wouldn't have frozen to death.

930
43:34.000 --> 43:34.800
Where's the money?

931
43:47.920 --> 43:48.440
Spent it.

932
43:58.760 --> 44:00.440
Have you ever searched your conscience?

933
44:01.960 --> 44:04.360
How do you face a soul that was misunderstood,

934
44:04.599 --> 44:05.840
slandered,

935
44:06.239 --> 44:08.480
and had its dignity trampled on?

936
44:09.320 --> 44:11.639
How do you face your own soul?

937
44:11.840 --> 44:13.440
Neither of us can withstand judgment.

938
44:14.719 --> 44:15.719
The judgment of the law.

939
44:16.559 --> 44:17.440
The judgment of morality.

940
44:18.039 --> 44:18.960
The judgment of conscience.

941
44:19.719 --> 44:21.880
Make more good films in the future.

942
44:22.239 --> 44:23.119
Films that are real,

943
44:23.920 --> 44:25.000
and deeply moving.

944
44:27.360 --> 44:27.960
Goodbye.
